      "content": "thanks for the suggestions. the binaural beats idea actually sounds promising. do u think there's a specific frequency range i should target to \"neutralize\" the suppression? like, if the aurasonics are hitting my creative centers with a low-level dampening signal, is there a mathematical way to calculate a counter-frequency so i can play it through my monitor or something? i'm an artist so i'm pretty tech-savvy with audio stuff, i just need help with the theory behind it.",
